# schema_fixtures.rs` and others), and a Windows checkout with git's default
# `core.autocrlf=true` rewrote every LF to CRLF and failed them. Every text
# file is LF on every platform; git's own content detection keeps binaries
# untouched.
* text=auto eol=lf
